# Build artifacts and dependencies
node_modules/
**/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Coverage and test output
**/coverage/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/blob-report/
**/.playwright/

# Lockfiles and generated content
pnpm-lock.yaml
# drizzle-kit-generated SQL migrations + snapshot/journal metadata: owned by the
# generator, kept byte-faithful to its output (Prettier has no SQL parser and
# would reflow the JSON snapshots away from what drizzle-kit writes/expects).
**/migrations/

# Pre-existing repo content this toolchain slice does not own — the concept
# docs, the vendored scenario fixtures (must stay byte-faithful to upstream),
# the agent configs and the dev infra file predate this slice; formatting them
# here would be an out-of-scope drive-by change.
docs/
scenarios/
.claude/
docker-compose.yml
CLAUDE.md
DEVELOPMENT.md

# Operator/deployment config owned outside the app toolchain — Grafana
# dashboard exports (ops/grafana/) must stay byte-faithful to what Grafana emits.
ops/grafana/

# Eval-harness run reports — generated by eval/src/cli.ts (byte-faithful to its
# JSON.stringify output) and gitignored via eval/reports/.gitignore. Prettier does
# not read nested .gitignore files, so list them here too or every eval run breaks
# `pnpm format`.
eval/reports/
